flowchart TD
    A([Employee attribute changes])
    --> B[Identify relevant User Groups]
    --> C[Evaluate Matching Criteria]
    --> D{Employee matches?}

    D -- No --> E([No membership change])

    D -- Yes --> F{Already a member?}

    F -- Yes --> E
    F -- No --> G[Add employee to User Group]
    --> H[Employee becomes eligible for assigned Roles]
    --> I[Update effective access]
    --> J([Completed])
